<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits in Zamfara have killed Governor Dauda Lawal's aide during Subhi prayer at a mosque and continue to abduct civilians, while the military rescued 119 abducted travellers and killed terrorists in a week. President Tinubu sought forgiveness for the Plateau attack and pledged reconstruction support, and AI-generated disinformation is influencing the upcoming election. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/nigeria-s-upcoming-election-marred-by-rising-ai-disinformation/a-79946897?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPQlR2dHlKVUFFZ0oyWHNFMmNuaVVJMHRNTHIwaXZKTk1CVkJ6empqSVoxVkc2TjJPTFYxZk9PR0UzbVZZeDRKV2FocWFqaFRUa01RVDc1TFR2N3R2T3lXbVBWWmVPQTByc05SZS1NS2dJd2Z3cDBDZmYtVHBWUTIyRzVRRnU?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxNcTlyWUJROHcxZUhFVlplbGY0eW5OckQ0S2wwdEpoMGJsNWxudkNQZjVUWW9aX0k3bGt3UGoxUHI1WUJIdGFVRGV4NnhiT0xDU3ZIZUR2OVptbmJ0VDRqMVl5ajhVQ0hSYlVSbmlYUy1rZlluUVZEX2xtR1NaNXB4emxBSWJSV0tiZFlvdldYNnhIXzJGYU95bHNIbE02TnUyOVF4Vi0ySQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Report Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxQSXdkdmxCUTNiWDd1ekNCNlJTMl96eXJPMDh6V2ZGSl8tYm5YejY4RWNqX3NrZ1VHbnN1OEx6YTJSbGNSWGlpWjlqZDlRQVBwUkZ2T1R1cXByZmVnaUpPZlliVmQ4NG10cVhHcW1nSE0tRkVhUlhiWlI0aWRIbFlad1dDMmhfMzh6cllUQ0tuaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Trust&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxOSXFXbGhTTmJEVTdZVE90UmZzc3ppLS0wS2dKUkhzS0cxTmg5X2c2bEdNZWJjNnJqcl9JWE1IalY2eHBlSm1idm82cDdDZDNYMlI1SFZDSDM4V1RPQ19qbG0tYXhYM2hPM0VEOUVYSlY3OG8wdGFramJCbFBTREVIdTl5MjZzOXU1ak5xZE1HbGNFWTlMM21ubUJPdlR2Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topic